      "options": {
        "content": "Current-fleet smoke view using existing node_exporter and Fibre OTel metric names. **No run completeness or benchmark success implied.** Select host and Fibre process separately; selectors are not an identity mapping. Host uptime is not Fibre process uptime. Blank metrics mean unavailable. Throughput uses decimal GB/s. Main-run target is **40 GB/s raw decimal = 37.2529 GiB/s for 600 seconds**; shard rates are encoded bytes and cannot be compared directly to that raw target.",
